---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About FreeToken" description="FreeToken data principles, verification workflow, and open-source information." lang="en">
  <article class="container" style="max-width: 760px; padding: 64px 24px;">
    <h1>About FreeToken</h1>
    <p>FreeToken tracks public free tiers from LLM and developer platforms, with links and integration guidance.</p>
    <h2>Data principles</h2>
    <p>Automated collection and model extraction only create proposals. Production data requires human review, and unknown requirements are shown as unverified.</p>
    <h2>Corrections and contributions</h2>
    <p>Submit an official source through GitHub Issues when an offer, link, or integration changes. Verification history is retained with each record.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
